.SH "نام (NAME)"
hugin \- Hugin panorama creator
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBhugin\fR \fIproject_file|image files ...\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Hugin is a GUI tool for panorama creation.
.PP
This man page is a stub, complete documentation of the GUI can be found in the online
manual available in the Help menu.  Moreover there are related CLI tools listed below
in the SEE ALSO section.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
Hugin has no command\-line options.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBalign_image_stack\fR\|(1)  \fBautooptimiser\fR\|(1)  \fBcalibrate_lens\fR\|(1)  \fBceleste_standalone\fR\|(1)
\&\fBcheckpto\fR\|(1)  \fBcpclean\fR\|(1)  \fBcpfind\fR\|(1)  \fBdeghosting_mask\fR\|(1)  \fBfulla\fR\|(1)  \fBgeocpset\fR\|(1)  \fBhugin_executor\fR\|(1)
\&\fBhugin_hdrmerge\fR\|(1) \fBhugin_lensdb\fR\|(1) \fBhugin_stitch_project\fR\|(1)  \fBicpfind\fR\|(1)  \fBlinefind\fR\|(1)  \fBnona\fR\|(1)  \fBpano_modify\fR\|(1)
\&\fBpano_trafo\fR\|(1)  \fBPTBatcherGUI\fR\|(1)  \fBpto_gen\fR\|(1)  \fBpto_merge\fR\|(1)  \fBpto_lensstack\fR\|(1) 
\&\fBpto_mask\fR\|(1)  \fBpto_merge\fR\|(1)  \fBpto_move\fR\|(1)  \fBpto_template\fR\|(1)  \fBpto_var\fR\|(1)  \fBtca_correct\fR\|(1)
\&\fBverdandi\fR\|(1) \fBvig_optimize\fR\|(1)
